            = succeed "-" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/E8"} E8
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/heterotic+string"} heterotic string
            the small instantons should also correspond to heterotic 5-branes there. That this is the case was argued, indirectly, in
            = succeed "," do
